---

## THE 8 DATABASE MODELS (Week 2 Task 3)
  User.ts         → users           (email, passwordHash, twoFactorSecret)
  Team.ts         → teams           (name, ownerId)
  TeamMember.ts   → team_members    (role: viewer / editor / admin)
  Folder.ts       → folders         (parentFolderId — self-reference for nesting)
  File.ts         → files           (isBeingEdited, editedBy, editingStartedAt)
  FileVersion.ts  → file_versions   (versionNumber, storagePath)
  Comment.ts      → comments        (content, resolved)
  ActivityLog.ts  → activity_logs   (action, targetType, targetId, metadata)
  SharedLink.ts   → shared_links    (token, passwordHash, expirationDate, downloadLimit)

